
================================================================================
                       THE SPIRE
================================================================================

The stairway rises up beyond sight.
The red glow of the rift fades behind you,
and there is nothing but darkness as you
ascend upward into silence.

================================================================================
                   EXPLORING HIDDEN DEPTHS
================================================================================

The spire rewards those who look carefully.
Remember your hidden-sight spells:

    ls -a            Reveal hidden rooms
    ls -la           Detailed view of everything

Some doors here are hidden even from 'ls'.
You may need to combine commands:

    ls -la | grep "^\."     Find hidden entries

================================================================================
                       NAVIGATION
================================================================================

    cd mezzanine     Continue ascending
    cd ..            Descend back to the rift

